# WSA-Next © 2026 Marek Wesołowski - wesmar
# ARM64 programs run through Google's ndk_translation; 32-bit ARM programs keep WSA's Houdini.
# The vendor init script registers Houdini for both from a property trigger; replace its
# ARM64 entries at boot, after all property triggers have run.
on boot && property:ro.enable.native.bridge.exec=1 && property:ro.dalvik.vm.isa.arm64=x86_64
    write /proc/sys/fs/binfmt_misc/arm64_exe -1
    write /proc/sys/fs/binfmt_misc/arm64_dyn -1
    copy /system/etc/binfmt_misc/arm64_exe /proc/sys/fs/binfmt_misc/register
    copy /system/etc/binfmt_misc/arm64_dyn /proc/sys/fs/binfmt_misc/register
